{
  "$comment": [
    "House Dark No Trailer assets. Technical metadata only.",
    "There is deliberately no film title, no mapping to a film, and no",
    "descriptive name anywhere in this file. openings.no_trailer_storage_path",
    "is client-visible before the reveal, so an asset path or manifest entry",
    "that named its film would hand the member the title while the picture",
    "is still sealed. The film-to-asset mapping belongs in the database,",
    "behind the owner-only tables, and is set through the Programming Desk.",
    "assetId order follows the upload digests, not the titles, so the",
    "numbering itself carries nothing either.",
    "approvedForPublicUse stays false until a human records the spoiler,",
    "rights and ownership checks the handover requires. Existing in the",
    "repository is not approval."
  ],
